 Goku's greatest strengths it is  precisely this naive and innocent  outlook on life that allows Goku to defy  common sense to reject what other people  consider to be realistic and practical  Goku refuses to take no for an answer  Goku refuses to accept that he cannot  defeat an opponent just because that  opponent happens to be far more powerful  than him in this particular moment and  this unique personality trait is exactly  what allows Goku to do the impossible  and overcome every single obstacle  someone who is a very rational realistic  and pragmatic person will assess the  situation and if they feel that their  opponent is way out of their league they  will know that it's time to quit and  accept the fee but not Goku Goku is  carefree  childish and idealistic sometimes he is  downright reckless but it is this  recklessness that always puts  over the top when other more rational  fighters hesitate when they back down  and when they want to give up Goku steps  up  Goku refuses to accept the fee he keeps  fighting he keeps trying to get stronger  he keeps trying to tap into greater  levels of power against all odds and  that is why Goku stands out from the  crowd you miss 100% of the shots you  don't take  and people who have a very rational and  realistic personality will not take the  shot if they think that the odds are  almost impossible but Goku will take  that shot every single time he doesn't  know the meaning of the word impossible  and that is why he succeeds where others  fail in this sense Goku reminds me a lot  of my favorite anime character of all  time coming up from Gurren Lagann  kameena literally has a saying kick  reason to the curb and do the impossible  he is all about rejecting common sense  if common sense tells you to give up and  he believes in fighting against all odds  because nothing is truly impossible if  you believe in yourself  Goku's innocent and naive personality  can be a weakness at times as we've seen  throughout Dragon Ball 